{"id": "3160970", "revid": "729837", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3160970", "title": "Alain Mosconi", "text": "Alain Mosconi () un \u00eenot\u0103tor ce a reprezentat Fran\u021ba, medaliat olimpic. A participat la 2 edi\u021bii ale Jocurilor Olimpice (1968, 1972) \u00een care a c\u00e2\u0219tigat o medalie de bronz.\n\u00cen 1973, dup\u0103 cariera sa sportiv\u0103, Alain Mosconi a lucrat pentru Berliet \u00een Algeria.\nUlterior a devenit director de v\u00e2nz\u0103ri pentru Ford Automobiles \u00een Fran\u021ba, apoi director general pentru General Motors Fran\u021ba (marca Opel), Seat Fran\u021ba \u0219i apoi pre\u0219edinte \u0219i CEO al Fiat Auto France (m\u0103rcile Fiat, Alfa Romeo \u0219i Lancia), \u00eenainte de a achizi\u021biona o reprezentan\u021b\u0103 BMW \u00een Avignon, pe care a condus-o p\u00e2n\u0103 \u00een 2007. \nParticip\u0103ri.\nLista de mai jos prezint\u0103 principalele competi\u021bii la care a participat Alain Mosconi de-a lungul carierei."}
